# VietLaw Limited Demo -- Docker build context exclusions.
#
# `Dockerfile.backend` only ever `COPY`s `backend_lite/requirements.txt`,
# `backend_lite/app`, `backend_lite/__init__.py`, and `data`, so most of
# these entries are defense in depth (the explicit COPY list already
# excludes everything else) rather than the only thing standing between a
# secret and the image -- but a smaller build context also uploads faster
# to the Docker daemon and never gets a chance to be copied by a future,
# less careful Dockerfile edit.
#
# Runtime-required legal JSON data (data/legal_snippets.json,
# data/traffic_rules.json, data/unsafe_patterns.json) is deliberately NOT
# excluded here -- only the local dev SQLite database and non-runtime data
# tooling artifacts are.

# -- version control -----------------------------------------------------
.git/
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
**/.git/

# -- the OTHER backend implementation and the frontend -------------------
# `backend/` is owned by another team member and is never built or started
# by Dockerfile.backend (see backend_lite/README.md). The frontend is a
# wholly separate Cloudflare Pages deployment (see DEPLOY_RAILWAY_
# CLOUDFLARE.md) -- this image never builds or serves it.
backend/
frontend/

# -- Node ------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# -- Python caches/venvs ---------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# -- local SQLite databases (never baked into the image; Railway mounts a
#    persistent volume for these at runtime instead) -----------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/*.sqlite3

# -- secrets / local env ----------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
*.secret

# -- reports not needed at runtime (documentation only, never imported) ----
*.md

# -- tests (never imported by the running application) ----------------------
backend_lite/tests/
evaluation/

# -- misc temporary / large binary files ------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.temp
tmp/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
